<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: Abidjan stock exchange shut Thursday for holiday.</title>
<headline>Abidjan stock exchange shut Thursday for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>ABIDJAN 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Abidjan stock exchange will be closed on Thursday for a Moslem public holiday.</p>
<p>The bourse authority said on Wednesday that a combined share and bond session would be held on Friday morning.</p>
<p>The bourse normally trades shares on Tuesday and Thursday mornings and bonds on Wednesday and Friday mornings.</p>
<p>-- Abidjan newsroom, +225 21 90 90</p>
</text>
